{"id":"n61178-4-7","stage":0,"title":"그렇다 · 那样","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61178-4-7-1","ko":"그동안 어떻게 지냈어?","zh":"这段时间过得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"지냈어?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"지내다：度过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"4","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지냈어","audio":"/audio/8833a72693bf7347d058.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"经过一定的时间。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a61f3cd10e5ac4ca9024.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61178-4-7-2","ko":"항상 그렇지 뭐.","zh":"还不是老样子呗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/41aaa9b473e6ee061308.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.2,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61178","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":6,"sequenceScore":-0.1987,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还不是老样子呗。","您想点哪道菜呢？","这段时间过得怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还不是老样子呗。","这段时间过得怎么样？","您想点哪道菜呢？"],"answer":0}]}
